WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.880
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:25.150 --> 00:29.380
[Live Forever]

3
00:30.630 --> 00:32.960
[Episode 19]

4
00:39.390 --> 00:40.710
Manager Qing Yuan.

5
00:40.960 --> 00:42.360
I brought you some fruit.

6
00:42.960 --> 00:43.890
Long time no see.

7
00:47.150 --> 00:48.210
Princess Ningjia.

8
01:24.070 --> 01:24.710
Qiu.

9
01:26.230 --> 01:26.920
Qiu.

10
01:32.479 --> 01:33.280
Qiu.

11
01:41.310 --> 01:42.310
Answer the phone.

12
01:43.190 --> 01:44.190
Answer the phone!

13
01:46.710 --> 01:49.770
I brought you some files about people who live forever.

14
01:52.000 --> 01:52.800
What's wrong?

15
01:53.860 --> 01:54.789
Qiu is in danger.

16
02:33.470 --> 02:34.430
You're awake.

17
02:44.050 --> 02:45.210
Does your head hurt?

18
02:46.390 --> 02:47.520
Are you still dizzy?

19
02:49.120 --> 02:50.910
Has it been a long time

20
02:51.280 --> 02:54.430
since you felt your life slipping away?

21
03:00.580 --> 03:02.820
You will keep bleeding.

22
03:07.190 --> 03:09.650
Ning Changyue will catch a cold and get sick.

23
03:10.380 --> 03:13.580
So falling in love really can undo the Vow to Live Forever.

24
03:14.120 --> 03:16.280
Princess Ningjia can live forever,

25
03:16.280 --> 03:18.079
as long as the heavens.

26
03:18.960 --> 03:20.490
Yet you gave it all up

27
03:24.940 --> 03:25.740
for a guard.

28
03:31.310 --> 03:33.470
Since you don't cherish it,

29
03:33.750 --> 03:35.430
I'll grant your wish.

30
03:37.750 --> 03:38.400
This

31
03:39.750 --> 03:42.150
is the palace dungeon from 3,000 years ago,

32
03:49.750 --> 03:50.590
the place you and that guard

33
03:50.590 --> 03:52.590
desperately wanted to leave.

34
03:58.600 --> 03:59.600
How about this?

35
04:01.190 --> 04:03.430
I'll bury you here today.

36
04:04.120 --> 04:04.840
Okay?

37
04:06.110 --> 04:07.550
Who exactly are you?

38
04:17.040 --> 04:19.000
Servant Liu Yi

39
04:19.589 --> 04:21.640
pays respects to Your Highness,

40
04:23.780 --> 04:25.740
Princess Ningjia.

41
04:34.310 --> 04:36.670
No wonder we could never find you.

42
04:37.200 --> 04:39.320
I don't know what dark magic you used

43
04:39.800 --> 04:41.560
to turn yourself into such a lingering

44
04:41.560 --> 04:44.430
half-human, half-ghost monster.

45
04:45.159 --> 04:47.310
Monster?

46
04:49.409 --> 04:50.760
Aren't you the same?

47
04:54.190 --> 04:56.159
Do you think all methods of living forever

48
04:56.159 --> 04:57.720
are as easy and costless

49
04:57.720 --> 04:58.920
as yours?

50
04:59.810 --> 05:01.040
I relied on the vengeful spirits

51
05:01.040 --> 05:03.700
of all the dead medicine slaves in Southern Qin,

52
05:03.800 --> 05:06.750
suffering the pain of shedding my skin and being reborn every hundred years

53
05:06.750 --> 05:09.240
just to barely survive. Yet you…

54
05:09.560 --> 05:12.560
You thief who stole the Tree Spirit of Immortality.

55
05:13.190 --> 05:15.360
You enjoy its blessings,

56
05:15.720 --> 05:18.780
yet you squander the power of living forever like this.

57
05:20.600 --> 05:22.400
What does our vow to live forever

58
05:23.600 --> 05:25.190
have to do with you?

59
05:25.760 --> 05:28.050
What does it have to do with me?

60
05:32.420 --> 05:34.870
What do you mean by "What does it have to do with me"?

61
05:34.870 --> 05:35.830
It was me

62
05:37.120 --> 05:39.750
who searched through all the ancient texts and visited all the famous mountains.

63
05:39.750 --> 05:43.630
It was me who tested the blood of all the medicine slaves.

64
05:43.630 --> 05:44.830
It was also me

65
05:44.830 --> 05:46.870
who had General Yu lock up the Tree Spirit

66
05:46.870 --> 05:48.390
in the darksteel cage.

67
05:52.040 --> 05:53.640
Once the elixir was refined,

68
05:54.240 --> 05:56.900
I would have taken it before that cursed emperor

69
05:57.270 --> 06:00.000
to achieve an immortal and indestructible body.

70
06:02.980 --> 06:05.220
My plan was flawless.

71
06:06.030 --> 06:07.390
It was you.

72
06:09.310 --> 06:10.680
It was you

73
06:11.310 --> 06:13.630
who ruined everything!

74
06:20.630 --> 06:21.630
Answer the phone.

75
06:25.040 --> 06:25.970
Okay, thank you.

76
06:27.480 --> 06:28.240
The auction house said,

77
06:28.240 --> 06:29.160
next, they'll send over

78
06:29.160 --> 06:30.720
all the information of Qing Yuan.

79
06:30.720 --> 06:33.120
We'll definitely find a way to locate them.

80
06:34.600 --> 06:35.400
Where are you?

81
06:35.630 --> 06:36.950
Why didn't you answer the phone?

82
06:36.950 --> 06:38.159
Guard Ning,

83
06:38.720 --> 06:40.050
I hope you've been well.

84
06:41.870 --> 06:42.470
Actually,

85
06:43.390 --> 06:44.560
Mr. Ning,

86
06:45.270 --> 06:47.800
are you looking for any collectibles lately?

87
06:51.390 --> 06:52.240
Let Qiu go.

88
06:52.810 --> 06:54.409
If you want someone, take me.

89
06:54.480 --> 06:56.070
It's been 3,000 years.

90
06:56.510 --> 06:59.920
You're still so self-righteous.

91
07:00.720 --> 07:02.190
Your princess

92
07:02.680 --> 07:06.340
is enjoying the mortal cycle of birth, aging, illness, and death.

93
07:06.800 --> 07:08.310
But what a pity.

94
07:09.270 --> 07:11.600
Her stolen blood of immortality

95
07:12.100 --> 07:14.430
doesn't seem to withstand much bleeding.

96
07:15.310 --> 07:16.510
In just a short while,

97
07:16.920 --> 07:19.390
her face turned as pale as paper.

98
07:20.070 --> 07:21.000
Your Highness,

99
07:21.510 --> 07:22.910
do you have any last words

100
07:23.720 --> 07:25.720
for your beloved guard?

101
07:26.560 --> 07:28.240
Princess. Guard.

102
07:29.470 --> 07:32.470
Do you really think this is the Southern Qin palace?

103
07:33.290 --> 07:35.500
You wretched eunuch.

104
07:37.920 --> 07:38.920
Your Highness,

105
07:38.920 --> 07:41.390
you're as annoying as ever.

106
07:44.530 --> 07:45.240
But if

107
07:45.240 --> 07:47.750
I make a few cuts on her body,

108
07:47.850 --> 07:48.940
will she still be

109
07:49.560 --> 07:50.950
so stubborn?

110
07:51.240 --> 07:52.159
Don't touch her!

111
07:52.159 --> 07:53.430
Or I'll make you pay!

112
07:54.270 --> 07:55.000
What?

113
07:55.600 --> 07:56.920
Want to find her?

114
07:59.630 --> 08:01.310
Don't you long-lived ones

115
08:02.170 --> 08:05.200
have a way to meet each other quickly?

116
08:06.000 --> 08:07.630
Once you're dead,

117
08:08.120 --> 08:09.800
you'll find her soon enough.

118
08:09.920 --> 08:10.830
It's just that

119
08:11.450 --> 08:14.280
the power of living forever is fading.

120
08:14.300 --> 08:15.860
If you die this time,

121
08:15.890 --> 08:17.450
you might really die.

122
08:17.510 --> 08:19.240
No, no.

123
08:19.630 --> 08:21.160
Ning Changyue, no!

124
08:26.920 --> 08:27.560
Calm down!

125
08:27.720 --> 08:28.310
Calm down!

126
08:28.310 --> 08:28.840
Lin Huai.

127
08:29.390 --> 08:30.120
Listen to me.

128
08:30.310 --> 08:31.160
As long as I die,

129
08:31.160 --> 08:32.480
she'll appear by my side immediately.

130
08:32.480 --> 08:33.270
She'll be safe.

131
08:33.270 --> 08:34.480
This is the only way!

132
08:35.440 --> 08:36.270
Come back!

133
08:36.750 --> 08:37.549
And then what?

134
08:38.030 --> 08:38.840
You died.

135
08:39.159 --> 08:40.740
Even if she escapes this time,

136
08:40.740 --> 08:42.340
can she escape the next time?

137
08:43.080 --> 08:44.440
Liu Yi just wants to watch you

138
08:44.440 --> 08:46.370
seek your own doom again and again.

139
08:47.030 --> 08:47.890
Ning Changyue,

140
08:48.550 --> 08:49.870
think carefully.

141
08:50.630 --> 08:52.870
You two have been together for 3,000 years.

142
08:52.870 --> 08:54.200
How many times have you died

143
08:54.200 --> 08:56.560
and lived together to get to where you are today?

144
08:56.560 --> 08:57.890
If you die today,

145
08:59.240 --> 09:00.600
will Liu Yi let her off?

146
09:12.320 --> 09:13.150
I'm asking someone

147
09:13.150 --> 09:14.440
to track the location of Song Yiqiu's phone,

148
09:14.440 --> 09:15.440
but it takes time.

149
09:15.680 --> 09:16.930
Think quickly now.

150
09:16.960 --> 09:18.250
Is there any place that is special

151
09:18.250 --> 09:19.580
for you and Song Yiqiu?

152
09:19.840 --> 09:20.750
He has planned this for so long.

153
09:20.750 --> 09:22.390
He couldn't have just picked a random place.

154
09:22.390 --> 09:22.990
Red light!

155
09:27.960 --> 09:28.690
Where is she?

156
09:29.600 --> 09:31.260
I must have missed something.

157
09:32.540 --> 09:35.400
Do you really think this is the Southern Qin palace?

158
09:36.310 --> 09:38.190
You wretched eunuch.

159
09:40.270 --> 09:41.670
The Southern Qin palace.

160
09:42.710 --> 09:43.360
What?

161
09:43.380 --> 09:45.950
The place where the Vow to Live Forever and Liu Yi's power began.

162
09:45.950 --> 09:48.210
It's also the place where our feud began.

163
09:56.000 --> 09:57.480
After so long,

164
09:58.120 --> 09:59.360
your Guard Ning

165
10:01.720 --> 10:04.120
hasn't said he would sacrifice his life

166
10:04.120 --> 10:05.240
to save you.

167
10:11.410 --> 10:13.770
Then he will never find this place.

168
10:14.950 --> 10:16.120
What a pity.

169
10:20.030 --> 10:21.790
Your love

170
10:21.790 --> 10:24.550
isn't that everlasting after all.

171
10:26.200 --> 10:28.330
So much for loving each other forever.

172
10:29.080 --> 10:30.790
So much for never parting.

173
10:31.750 --> 10:32.750
In the end,

174
10:33.480 --> 10:35.280
you only care about yourselves.

175
10:35.630 --> 10:37.360
You're deceiving yourselves.

176
10:38.270 --> 10:39.440
Love

177
10:40.870 --> 10:43.030
isn't only real if you die

178
10:43.750 --> 10:45.120
for each other.

179
10:46.270 --> 10:47.840
Our love

180
10:49.000 --> 10:50.860
is just about wanting to live well

181
10:51.390 --> 10:52.840
with each other.

182
11:00.750 --> 11:03.630
So what if you've lived for thousands of years?

183
11:05.390 --> 11:06.340
In the end,

184
11:08.240 --> 11:10.900
you don't understand the meaning of love at all.

185
11:12.360 --> 11:14.550
This broken immortality of yours

186
11:15.790 --> 11:18.750
makes you nothing but a walking corpse.

187
11:18.900 --> 11:20.050
What do you know?

188
11:20.910 --> 11:21.840
I have love.

189
11:23.480 --> 11:25.010
I love my younger sister.

190
11:26.030 --> 11:27.030
My younger sister

191
11:27.430 --> 11:29.950
could have lived forever with me.

192
11:29.980 --> 11:31.380
Take this identity token

193
11:31.400 --> 11:32.910
and go out through the west corner gate.

194
11:32.910 --> 11:35.710
Everything Lord Ning arranged is still in effect.

195
11:36.810 --> 11:38.170
Because you two

196
11:39.240 --> 11:41.270
took away the immortality that belonged to her.

197
11:41.270 --> 11:42.120
Xiaoyuan.

198
11:47.940 --> 11:49.970
You are Xiaoyuan's older brother.

199
11:52.320 --> 11:55.510
You are actually Xiaoyuan's older brother.

200
11:56.200 --> 11:57.330
Have mercy, my lord!

201
11:57.460 --> 11:58.860
I can't leave the palace.

202
11:59.150 --> 12:00.360
I can't leave!

203
12:00.630 --> 12:01.490
Your Highness,

204
12:01.770 --> 12:03.120
I am doing this willingly.

205
12:03.120 --> 12:03.790
I entered the palace

206
12:03.790 --> 12:05.840
to look for my long-lost brother.

207
12:06.190 --> 12:06.950
For now,

208
12:06.970 --> 12:08.570
my brother is still missing.

209
12:09.270 --> 12:10.510
I can't leave.

210
12:10.670 --> 12:11.910
Lord Ning helped me.

211
12:12.440 --> 12:14.700
His wish is to help you escape the palace.

212
12:14.720 --> 12:16.720
I will also escape during the chaos.

213
12:17.550 --> 12:17.960
Hurry.

214
12:17.960 --> 12:18.670
No.

215
12:19.670 --> 12:20.530
Your Highness.

216
12:21.000 --> 12:22.240
After you escape,

217
12:22.430 --> 12:23.640
the world is vast.

218
12:24.720 --> 12:26.000
Your Highness, I hope

219
12:26.280 --> 12:27.800
you get what you wish for.

220
12:29.510 --> 12:30.750
I didn't expect

221
12:32.800 --> 12:35.530
that Xiaoyuan was sent by her own brother

222
12:36.550 --> 12:39.270
to be a blood-testing medicine slave.

223
12:40.220 --> 12:41.650
She could have been free,

224
12:42.170 --> 12:44.830
but she chose to stay in the palace voluntarily,

225
12:45.830 --> 12:47.160
just for…

226
12:47.550 --> 12:48.270
For…

227
12:50.510 --> 12:51.270
For what?

228
12:51.720 --> 12:52.510
For what?

229
12:55.620 --> 12:58.280
♪ Always secretly guessing ♪

230
12:57.200 --> 13:00.200
Just for reuniting with you.

231
12:59.610 --> 13:06.190
♪ Always wondering who's looking ♪

232
13:01.600 --> 13:03.600
Xiaoyuan came looking for me?

233
13:05.600 --> 13:06.600
No.

234
13:06.470 --> 13:11.610
♪ The evil still quietly approaches ♪

235
13:07.360 --> 13:09.090
I didn't mean to kill Xiaoyuan.

236
13:10.000 --> 13:11.080
I didn't mean to.

237
13:14.480 --> 13:15.790
It was you

238
13:15.790 --> 13:17.240
who let the princess go?

239
13:28.000 --> 13:29.630
You are all sinners.

240
13:33.870 --> 13:35.440
Give me back

241
13:40.440 --> 13:42.680
my immortality.

242
13:48.360 --> 13:50.270
Brother.

243
13:57.870 --> 13:58.910
Xiaoyuan.

244
14:14.330 --> 14:15.240
What?

245
14:16.150 --> 14:17.120
You killed her?

246
14:18.790 --> 14:20.840
It was you who killed her!

247
14:21.590 --> 14:23.070
How could you

248
14:23.560 --> 14:25.730
kill your own sister?

249
14:27.480 --> 14:30.200
She only wanted to reunite with you.

250
14:31.530 --> 14:34.250
She just wanted to find you.

251
14:34.920 --> 14:35.920
No.

252
14:35.940 --> 14:37.000
It's not like that.

253
14:38.130 --> 14:39.440
She deserved to die.

254
14:39.910 --> 14:41.390
Xiaoyuan deserved to die.

255
14:42.070 --> 14:44.200
She deserved to die in the first place.

256
14:45.090 --> 14:46.640
It's all because of you.

257
14:47.130 --> 14:48.280
It's you.

258
14:48.850 --> 14:50.570
It's all because of you.

259
15:14.970 --> 15:17.140
♪ So here is to you ♪

260
15:19.570 --> 15:22.580
♪ My darling ♪

261
15:23.460 --> 15:26.810
♪ And here is to you ♪

262
15:27.520 --> 15:30.840
♪ My friend ♪

263
15:31.560 --> 15:34.550
♪ Here is to you ♪

264
15:35.390 --> 15:38.360
♪ My lover ♪

265
15:39.480 --> 15:51.950
♪ I'll follow you until the end ♪

266
15:46.240 --> 15:46.790
Qiu.

267
15:51.150 --> 15:51.670
Here.

268
15:52.000 --> 15:52.600
Slow down.

269
15:53.100 --> 16:01.660
♪ I'll follow you until ♪

270
15:53.910 --> 15:54.480
Qiu.

271
15:54.870 --> 15:55.440
Qiu.

272
15:56.750 --> 15:57.600
Are you okay?

273
15:58.120 --> 15:59.320
Where did he hurt you?

274
15:59.690 --> 16:00.730
I'm fine.

275
16:01.910 --> 16:03.030
Are you okay?

276
16:04.840 --> 16:05.510
I'm fine.

277
16:07.720 --> 16:08.440
Are you okay?

278
16:08.440 --> 16:09.440
Why wouldn't I be?

279
16:10.150 --> 16:10.600
Here.

280
16:13.120 --> 16:14.120
Let me take a look.

281
16:14.240 --> 16:15.480
I'm fine.

282
16:16.510 --> 16:17.440
Qiu.

283
16:19.360 --> 16:20.720
We are both safe now.

284
16:21.120 --> 16:21.650
Let's go.

285
16:21.750 --> 16:22.440
Let's go home.
